### ─── PropertyLoop Shortlet Bookings & Rental Applications ──────────────────
### Login as buyer
# @name loginBuyer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{buyerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{buyerPassword}}"
}

### Login as agent (to get listing IDs)
# @name loginAgent
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{agentEmail}}",
  "password": "{{agentPassword}}"
}

### Get agent's listings
# @name agentListings
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings/me/all
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgent.response.body.accessToken}}
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### SHORTLET BOOKINGS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ═══ 1. Book a shortlet ═══
### NOTE: This requires a SHORTLET listing to exist. Use the shortlet listing
### created in 04-listings.http. Replace the listingId if needed.
# @name bookShortlet
POST {{baseUrl}}/shortlet-bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listingId": "{{agentListings.response.body.items[0].id}}",
  "guestName": "Tunde Akinola",
  "guestPhone": "+2348012345678",
  "guestEmail": "tunde.buyer@test.com",
  "guests": 2,
  "checkIn": "2026-04-25T14:00:00.000Z",
  "checkOut": "2026-04-28T11:00:00.000Z",
  "paymentMethod": "card"
}

### ═══ 2. List buyer's shortlet bookings ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/shortlet-bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 3. Get single booking ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/shortlet-bookings/{{bookShortlet.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 4. Cancel shortlet booking ═══
POST {{baseUrl}}/shortlet-bookings/{{bookShortlet.response.body.id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### RENTAL APPLICATIONS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ═══ 5. Apply for a rental ═══
### NOTE: This requires a RENT listing. Use the rental listing created in 04-listings.http.
# @name applyRental
POST {{baseUrl}}/rental-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listingId": "{{agentListings.response.body.items[0].id}}",
  "applicantName": "Tunde Akinola",
  "applicantPhone": "+2348012345678",
  "applicantEmail": "tunde.buyer@test.com",
  "deposit": 3500000,
  "agencyFee": 350000,
  "legalFee": 150000,
  "leaseDuration": "12 months",
  "startDate": "2026-05-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "paymentMethod": "transfer"
}

### ═══ 6. List rental applications ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/rental-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 7. Get single application ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/rental-applications/{{applyRental.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 8. Mark deposit paid ═══
POST {{baseUrl}}/rental-applications/{{applyRental.response.body.id}}/deposit-paid
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 9. Sign agreement (activates lease, releases escrow) ═══
POST {{baseUrl}}/rental-applications/{{applyRental.response.body.id}}/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 10. Verify: status=ACTIVE, escrowStatus=RELEASED, signedAt set ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/rental-applications/{{applyRental.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 11. Cancel flow (new application) ═══
# @name cancelRental
POST {{baseUrl}}/rental-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listingId": "{{agentListings.response.body.items[0].id}}",
  "applicantName": "Tunde Akinola",
  "applicantPhone": "+2348012345678",
  "deposit": 3500000,
  "agencyFee": 350000,
  "legalFee": 150000,
  "leaseDuration": "12 months",
  "startDate": "2026-06-01T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### ═══ 12. Cancel the application ═══
POST {{baseUrl}}/rental-applications/{{cancelRental.response.body.id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
